# Testing and Verification

## Framework

- Vitest + jsdom + Testing Library (`npm test`, `npm run test:watch`)
- Setup: `src/test-setup.ts`
- Prefer behavioral / unit tests over shallow render-only checks
- Mock Supabase with `vi.hoisted()` when factories need shared mocks

## Coverage priorities

- Import converters (`markdownToTiptap`, `txtToTiptap`)
- Document API error propagation / happy paths (mocked)
- Sharing and unauthorized access where feasible (note: real RLS is DB-enforced)

## Reporting

- Run and report real results for: `npm test`, `npm run lint`, `npm run build`
- `npm run build` runs `tsc -b` then Vite — do not invent pass/fail
- Mark checks that could not run as **Not Verified**
- Before push, use the `pre-push-verification` skill
